1. Save it as a separate PHP file (e.g., `generateChartData.php`) in the same directory as your main HTML file.

2. In your main HTML file, replace the placeholders for `$labelsAltasPorArea` and `$valuesAltasPorArea` with calls to this PHP script using AJAX. Similarly, do the same for `$labelsBajasPorArea` and `$valuesBajasPorArea`.

